---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '@/styles/components/NotFound.css';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Página no encontrada"
 
 
>
  <section class="not-found on-dark surface-grain relative overflow-hidden pt-32 pb-16 text-cream lg:pt-48 lg:pb-32" aria-labelledby="not-found-title">
    <div class="not-found__spores" aria-hidden="true">
      <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>
    </div>

    <div class="container-editorial relative grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-8 split:grid-cols-12 split:gap-16">
      <p class="not-found__code absolute -top-18 right-0 font-display text-error-code font-light text-cream/6 pointer-events-none select-none" aria-hidden="true">404</p>

      <div class="relative z-1 max-w-160 split:col-span-8">
        <p class="eyebrow text-apple">Error 404 · Fuera del mapa</p>
        <h1 id="not-found-title" class="type-display mt-5 text-error-title text-cream">
          Esta página<br />
          <span class="italic font-light text-apple">no germinó.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-120 text-copy leading-relaxed text-cream/60">
          Puede que el enlace esté mal escrito, que la página haya cambiado de lugar o que nunca
          haya existido. El bosque sigue aquí: elige por dónde seguir.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href="/" class="btn btn--apple">Volver al inicio</a>
          <a href="/ediciones" class="btn btn--outline">Ver ediciones</a>
        </div>

        <nav class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2.5 border-t border-cream/16 pt-5" aria-label="Otras secciones">
          <a href="/new-fungi" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono text-eyebrow uppercase tracking-widest text-cream/62 transition-colors hover:text-apple">New Fungi <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          <a href="/fotografias" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono text-eyebrow uppercase tracking-widest text-cream/62 transition-colors hover:text-apple">Fotografías <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          <a href="/red-micelio" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono text-eyebrow uppercase tracking-widest text-cream/62 transition-colors hover:text-apple">Red Micelio <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          <a href="/#contacto" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono text-eyebrow uppercase tracking-widest text-cream/62 transition-colors hover:text-apple">Contacto <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </nav>
      </div>

      <figure class="not-found__figure opacity-92 split:col-span-4" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 220 260" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-auto w-full">
          <path
            d="M110 96c-31 0-56 20-56 44 0 9 7 14 16 14h80c9 0 16-5 16-14 0-24-25-44-56-44Z"
            fill="#9ed954"
            fill-opacity="0.16"
            stroke="#9ed954"
            stroke-width="1.5"
          />
          <path
            d="M110 96c17 0 31 6 41 16-9 4-24 7-41 7s-32-3-41-7c10-10 24-16 41-16Z"
            fill="#9ed954"
            fill-opacity="0.35"
          />
          <path
            d="M110 154v58c0 10-8 18-18 18"
            stroke="#9ed954"
            stroke-width="1.5"
            stroke-linecap="round"
          />
          <path
            d="M110 182c10 0 18-6 23-16"
            stroke="#9ed954"
            stroke-width="1.5"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-opacity="0.7"
          />
          <circle cx="46" cy="70" r="2.5" fill="#9ed954" fill-opacity="0.5" />
          <circle cx="176" cy="58" r="3.5" fill="#9ed954" fill-opacity="0.35" />
          <circle cx="188" cy="150" r="2" fill="#9ed954" fill-opacity="0.5" />
          <circle cx="34" cy="170" r="3" fill="#9ed954" fill-opacity="0.3" />
          <path d="M40 230h140" stroke="#f7f4eb" stroke-opacity="0.18" stroke-width="1" />
        </svg>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
